@startuml seq_dang_nhap
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #990033
skinparam ActorBorderColor #990033
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFCC
skinparam UsecaseBorderColor #990033
skinparam UsecaseBackgroundColor #FFFFCC
skinparam ClassBorderColor #990033
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #FFFFCC
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #990033
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFCC
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor #FFFFCC
skinparam BoundaryBorderColor #990033
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor #FFFFCC
skinparam ControlBorderColor #990033
skinparam EntityBackgroundColor #FFFFCC
skinparam EntityBorderColor #990033
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #444444
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFFCC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #990033
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
autonumber
hide footbox
actor "Nguoi dung" as U
boundary "DangNhapUI" as UI
control "DangNhapController" as C
entity "users" as US
entity "xac_thuc_vai_tro" as XT
U -> UI : Dieu huong den man hinh dang nhap()
UI -> UI : Hien thi form dang nhap()
U -> UI : Nhap ten dang nhap, mat khau va kich nut "Dang nhap"
UI -> C : Kiem tra thong tin dang nhap()
C -> C : Kiem tra so lan nhap sai()
C -> US : Tim tai khoan theo ten dang nhap()
US --> C : return thong tin tai khoan
C -> C : So sanh mat khau (bcrypt)()
note right of C
Neu sai mat khau hoac tai khoan bi khoa:
tra ve thong bao loi
end note
C -> XT : Kiem tra vai tro co bat xac thuc hai lop()
XT --> C : return cau hinh
C --> UI : return ket qua
note right of UI
Neu vai tro dang bat xac thuc hai lop
(mac dinh Admin, Ke toan): yeu cau nhap ma.
Vai tro khong bat: cap token ngay
end note
UI -> UI : Hien thi form nhap ma 6 so()
U -> UI : Nhap ma 6 so tu ung dung xac thuc
UI -> C : Xac minh ma hai lop()
C -> US : Kiem tra ma TOTP()
C -> US : Cap nhat buoc ma da dung()
US --> C : return ket qua
C -> C : Cap token dang nhap()
C --> UI : return token
UI -> UI : Hien thi trang Tong quan theo vai tro()
@enduml
